                                                "sense_id": "efae1d88-41ee-3ed6-8670-7401a8973330",
                                                "text": "The doctor sewed up the laceration in his arm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1b00ce9-51d3-4bda-a7fe-4ef571397c67",
                                                "sense_id": "efae1d88-41ee-3ed6-8670-7401a8973330",
                                                "text": "Survivors of the crash suffered injuries ranging from broken bones to lacerations, permanent disfigurements, and psychiatric trauma."
